nProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The standard code path for type detection takes assignments into account when picking the expression from which to guess the type.\r\n```gdscript\r\nvar a\r\na = \"hello\"\r\na. # suggests string methods\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis special code path for GET_NODE does not do that right now and only works with the initializer of the variable.\r\n\r\nBut to support that without duplicating a lot of code, we'd probably need to remove `_get_subscript_type` and integrate GET_NODE into the standard `_guess_expression_type` code path. So it isn't a quick fix, which is why I just added a comment about it for now.","created_at":"2025-06-17T15:47:26Z","updated_at":"2025-06-17T15:47:27Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107636#discussion_r2152609627","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107636","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2152609627"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107636#discussion_r2152609627"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107636"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2152609627/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":3145,"original_line":3145,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2152597035,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":6,"position":6,"subject_type":"line"}]